Feeling tired and hopeless can make relationships a struggle.  Approach the situation with compassion, understanding, and two-track communication. Change and support can enrich what is lacking both from you. You can prioritize goal setting yourself, if the situation doesn't correct enough, then seeking help from a therapist is a better option to achieve mutual understanding.

